---
const { items = [] } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/004-rocket.png" alt="Reliable Backup" class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto" />
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
                <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Reliable Offsite Backup..</h2>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    Data backup is important for small business owners to invest in because it ensures that their important data is protected and can be easily restored in the event of a disaster or other data loss event. Having a good backup strategy in place can help minimize the impact of data loss on a business and get it back up and running quickly.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
